Revision history for Text::MarkdownAdoc

0.1.1   2026-11-02
        - Fix: square brackets that are not a link, an image or a defined
          reference are now kept as literal text. anchor:X[X] and
          "see [X] now" used to lose their brackets, so a document did
          not survive a round trip through Text::AsciidocDown. The
          unresolved forms [text], [text][] and [text][label] are
          emitted as written.
        - Fix: an undefined shorthand reference whose label contains a
          colon no longer leaves a raw placeholder in the output.

0.1.0   2026-07-07
        - First public release
